<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The undersigned (&ldquo;Stockholder&rdquo;) hereby
requests the removal of restrictive legend(s) on an aggregate of _____________ shares (the &ldquo;Shares&rdquo;) of Class A Common Stock
of Maison Solutions Inc. (the &ldquo;Company&rdquo;) represented in book entry form (BE ____). In connection with this request, Stockholder
